        "title": "Mechanized Attack",
        "extract": "Mechanized Attack (メカナイズド・アタック, Mekanaizudo Atakku) is a shooter game developed and published by SNK. It was released in North America for the arcade in 1989, and it was ported to the Nintendo Entertainment System in 1990. It can be played with either the NES controller or the NES Zapper light gun.\n\n",
