        "extract": "Akka Arrh is a 2023 tower defense multidirectional shooter video game developed by Llamasoft and published by Atari. It is based on a prototype which dates back to the 1980s but was never publicly released. It was released for Atari VCS, Microsoft Windows, Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4 and 5, Xbox One and Series X/S.\n\n",
